  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Directly deployable single-Spark canary using the exact official gated LTX-2.5 BF16 Diffusers closure with a fixed FP8 E4M3FN layerwise-storage and sequential-offload execution path. The pinned transformer closure contains 37,976,221,088 bytes of BF16 shards; the 110 GB startup and 96 GB steady declarations claim only 8 GB of the resulting storage reduction, retain 6 GB growth and 10 GB system reserve, and admit at 120 GB. A 505-byte license/token probe runs before the 70 GB model transfer. Exact-license acknowledgement, same-account Hugging Face access, physical authenticated installation, memory measurement, and GB10 audiovisual qualification remain required.",
