            "details": "Diffusers moved from d035dcd7 to c5469b7c and includes runtime changes across pipelines and loading paths. The exact LTX-2.5 fp8 cast checkpoint and canary adapter remain pinned until focused ARM64 build and serving checks cover the range.",
