              "https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers/blob/d035dcd7cc7c88e0a154609b62887d50bba9fdc2/docs/source/en/optimization/memory.md"
            ],
            "summary": "Added a distinct LTX-2.5 single-Spark physical canary with immutable FP8 E4M3FN layerwise storage and sequential offload."
          }
        ],
